        "id": 245764,
        "name": "Chris Hanson",
        "username": "SaveVersus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/saveversus/{size}/5425_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-06-28T16:29:46.272Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hiya.</p>\n<p>I’m trying to find a way to contact GTG besides their Contact email.<br>\nI got a FedEx notification that GTG mailed a package to me, but I’ve moved. I went through all my backed projects and updated my address, but I guess this one didn’t go through.</p>\n<p>I’ve contacted FedEx to ask if I can just show up at the facility and pick the package up, but FedEx says the <em>shipper</em> needs to make that request, not me.</p>\n<p>I emailed GTG through their Contact email, but haven’t gotten a reply, and I’m running out of time.</p>\n<p>If anyone has a different point of contact, or if a mod or someone could run this up the ladder, any help would be appreciated. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grinning.png?v=12\" title=\":grinning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grinning:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2022-06-28T16:29:46.272Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 3,
        "reads": 34,
        "readers_count": 33,
        "score": 21.8,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 29429,
        "topic_slug": "question-re-contacting-gtg",
        "display_username": "Chris Hanson",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
