        "read": false,
        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Hiya.\n\nI'm trying to find a way to contact GTG besides their Contact email.\nI got a FedEx notification that GTG mailed a package to me, but I've moved. I went through all my backed projects and updated my address, but I guess this one didn't go through.\n\nI've contacted FedEx to ask if I can just show up at the facility and pick the package up, but FedEx says the *shipper* needs to make that request, not me.\n\nI emailed GTG through their Contact email, but haven't gotten a reply, and I'm running out of time.\n\nIf anyone has a different point of contact, or if a mod or someone could run this up the ladder, any help would be appreciated. :grinning:",
